### First page
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/catalog?limit=2&offset=0

### Second page
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/catalog?limit=2&offset=2

### Filter and sort
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/catalog?category=accessories&sort_by=price_paise&order=desc

### Search
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/catalog?search=desk

### Invalid sort column -> 422
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/catalog?sort_by=secret
